WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
a shipwreck

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:03,920
I was living on a deserted island with fifteen women. They thought we were

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,640
The only man doing anything was kicked out of the camp

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:09,510
I could live a better life, but I didn’t expect a loophole

5
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:29,410
This list is hell. My name is Lin Feng.

6
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:32,290
The most inexperienced people in the company: Ma Hainan and Shen Soucai

7
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,370
Survive as a man to me

8
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:36,850
I'm looking for fifteen now in a big camp alone

9
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:38,490
They're going to vote me out

10
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:41,180
Good luck today

11
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:44,500
Four fish, enough water for two meals, boiled tea, and plenty of tea.

12
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:49,330
I can finally sleep peacefully at night. I suggest

13
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:52,000
What's the reason for driving Lin Feng out of the camp?

14
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,150
Just because you are a man

15
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,390
There is no signal on the island

16
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:56,590
Who knows when rescue will come?

17
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:57,670
We have so many girls

18
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:58,910
You're the only man in the middle

19
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:00,950
It's okay during the day, but at night, who can guarantee you?

20
00:01:00,950 --> 00:01:03,150
You won't do anything to me while we're asleep

21
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:08,200
Really drive her away, wait a minute

22
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,600
She rode Pengzi

23
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,680
She started the fire

24
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,320
What fish and fruits have I eaten these days?

25
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:14,520
She was the one who found her and drove her away.

26
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:19,980
Who does all this work? Jiang Yu, what do you mean?

27
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,220
Speak for her like this

28
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:22,300
You are so in need of a man

29
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:24,260
There are so many girls on the island

30
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:28,880
If you have to be an outsider like this, you are Teacher Jiang

31
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,920
Aren't you usually quite aloof?

32
00:01:31,440 --> 00:01:32,760
How come we share the meal together?

33
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:33,920
Just stand with the men.

34
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,700
I'm talking about the fact that without her, whoever gets angry will catch the fish.

35
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:41,860
What kind of work can't we do without her?

36
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:45,020
We are still alive, what do you think, Sister Yao?

37
00:01:49,130 --> 00:01:53,340
What Weiwei said makes sense. Safety comes first.

38
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:58,900
It never hurts to be cautious. I agree with safety first. I also agree with the vote.

39
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:02,420
Raise your hands if you agree to let her move away?

40
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,120
Eleven votes in favor and four votes against

41
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:12,620
The minority obeys the majority and you can leave.
